sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant CLI      as cli.py
    participant Pipe     as pipeline.py
    participant Download as download.py
    participant Audio    as audio.py
    participant LangID   as langid.py
    participant ASR      as asr.py
    participant YT       as yt-dlp
    participant FF       as ffmpeg
    participant Runner   as runners/*.py (venv)

    User->>CLI: localcaption <url> [--language auto]
    CLI->>Pipe: transcribe_url(url, out_dir, language)

    rect rgb(220, 252, 231)
    note right of Pipe: Stage 1 · Download
    Pipe->>Download: download_audio(url, work_dir)
    Download->>YT: YoutubeDL(opts).extract_info(url, download=True)
    note over YT: all traffic via the SOCKS5 proxy
    YT-->>Download: info dict (id, title, chapters, ...)
    Download-->>Pipe: Path(audio_file)
    end

    rect rgb(219, 234, 254)
    note right of Pipe: Stage 2 · Re-encode
    Pipe->>Audio: to_wav(audio, wav_path)
    Audio->>FF: subprocess(ffmpeg -ac 1 -ar 16000 -c:a pcm_s16le)
    FF-->>Audio: 16 kHz mono WAV
    Audio-->>Pipe: Path(wav_file)
    end

    rect rgb(254, 249, 195)
    note right of Pipe: Stage 3 · Language ID
    Pipe->>LangID: detect_language(wav)  [when language=auto]
    LangID->>Runner: run_runner(langid-ecapa, window=6s, max-windows=16)
    Runner-->>LangID: {name, score, scores}
    LangID-->>Pipe: LangIdResult (confident?)
    end

    rect rgb(252, 231, 243)
    note right of Pipe: Stage 4 · Routed ASR
    Pipe->>ASR: transcribe(wav, out_base, model)
    note over ASR: ru → Qwen3-ASR<br/>en → Parakeet TDT<br/>other / unclear → Nemotron
    ASR->>Runner: run_runner(model, window=45s)
    Runner-->>ASR: {text, language, segments[]}
    ASR->>ASR: write .txt / .srt / .vtt / .json
    ASR-->>Pipe: TranscriptionResult
    end

    Pipe->>Pipe: chapters + search index (+ optional Ollama summary)
    Pipe->>Pipe: shutil.rmtree(work_dir)  [unless --keep-audio]
    Pipe-->>CLI: PipelineResult
    CLI-->>User: print transcript paths + body
